      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.1",
      "title": "Definition",
      "body": "● Neck protection is the term to describe all historical and adapted protection for neck, shoulders and throat. In buhurt, those protections are mandatory to ensure the safety of competitors.\n● Neck protection can be worn upon the aventail or not, depending on the type of protection.",
