    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.2",
      "title": "Neck protection description",
      "body": "Neck protection can be:\n● Neck shield : Metal plates that replicate the shape of a heater shield. It is allowed to be worn upon the aventail.\n● Lobster tail : Articulated metal plates designed as a lobster tail. It is allowed to be worn upon the aventail.\n● Gorget : A gorget is a plate protection that covers the neck, shoulders and throat. It is allowed to be visible and worn with the proper armor set.\n● Concealed neck plates : Metal plates directly sewn to the gambeson or the aventail.\nThey must be hidden under the aventail.",
