    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "1.3",
      "title": "General requirements",
      "body": "All types of neck protection must respect the following requirements :\n● Be based on historical sources if they are visible.\n● Be concealed if they are not based on historical sources.\n● Be firmly attached to prevent any breakage and maintain a high level of protection in any case.\n● Any metal part of the neck protection must conform to the Armors and weapons Aesthetics and decorations document.\n● Any textile or leather part of the neck protection must conform to the Textiles and Leather document.",
