    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "4.2",
      "title": "Specific requirements",
      "body": "● Gorget must conform to the general requirements (1.3)\n● Gorget must be constructed from plates.\n● Gorget must cover the clavicles and back of the neck. The throat should have a low profile, be articulated or otherwise fitted in such a way that it doesn’t choke the wearer when their head is tilted forward.\n● Gorget must be worn with appropriate armor styles and match historical sources in function and appearance.",
