    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "depth": 1,
      "kind": "rule",
      "number": "5.2",
      "title": "Specific requirements",
      "body": "● Concealed neck plates must conform to the general requirements (1.3)\n● Concealed neck plates must be made of metal.\n● Concealed neck plates must be hidden under the aventail.\n● Concealed neck plates must be firmly attached.\n● Edges of concealed neck plates must be smooth with no sharp edges.\n● It is recommended to paint concealed neck plates with anti rust paint. Such paint must be a neutral color (grey, black) and do not interfere with the aesthetic of the armor.",
